# Chapter 1: A New Day

Cornellius wakes up and mans his ship, alone.  A storm looms in the distance but Cornellius sees a magical creature where the storm will hit.  He goes to it.

# Chapter 2: A Wish

Cornellius and the Creature talk to each other.  The Creature offers Cornellius one wish if he can rescue the Creature from the Storm

# Chapter 3: The Storm

Cornellius rescues the Creature, allowing him one wish.  He wishes to go home where he finds hundreds of cats waiting for him
